    "detailed_description": "<strong><i>Unique Maps</i></strong><br>Each map has several puzzles that the players have to solve to get to the next maps. Per map there are about 3 or more puzzles, so pay attention and do not get confused otherwise the monsters will come and get you.<br><br><strong><i>User interface</i></strong><br>The game offers a clear and good looking interface which is very easy to use<br><br><strong><i>Sounds</i></strong><br>The game has ambient sounds that adapt to the maps. In addition, the player will hear his own footsteps that adapt to the ground, as well as the steps of monsters. There are also sounds for opening boxes, doors and much more, so that the user has a good sound experience.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong><i>Unique Maps</i></strong><br>Each map has several puzzles that the players have to solve to get to the next maps. Per map there are about 3 or more puzzles, so pay attention and do not get confused otherwise the monsters will come and get you.<br><br><strong><i>User interface</i></strong><br>The game offers a clear and good looking interface which is very easy to use<br><br><strong><i>Sounds</i></strong><br>The game has ambient sounds that adapt to the maps. In addition, the player will hear his own footsteps that adapt to the ground, as well as the steps of monsters. There are also sounds for opening boxes, doors and much more, so that the user has a good sound experience.",
    "short_description": "Survive The Backrooms is a multiplayer CO-OP horror story game. The game is about 4 strangers who all have a dream and are now trapped in the backrooms. They can free themselves by solving the riddles and escaping the monsters.",
